      "comment": "Class = \"NSButton\"; ibShadowedToolTip = \"For terminal applications that use mouse reporting, turning this on allows right click (or two finger tap on a trackpad) to be reported instead of opening the context menu.\"; ObjectID = \"ZG1-dm-1gD\";",
