          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "For this setting to take effect you must disable \"Native full screen windows\" in Settings > General. If this setting is enabled, the menu bar will remain visible. This is useful for multi-monitor systems."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要使此设置生效，你必须在设置 > 通用中禁用「原生全屏窗口」。启用此设置后，菜单栏将保持可见。这对多显示器系统很有用。"
